        "Description": "Good evening, 47. Today you return to Bangkok to tie up some loose ends. We have four targets tonight. They are either key researchers for the Second Saint&apos;s Eyes project or cult members. We don&apos;t know the exact nature of their connection, but our client isn&apos;t willing to take any risks. You simply need to eliminate them, and I will send a small ICA team to steal the statue from Jordan Cross&apos;s apartment. Good luck agent. Have fun!",
